                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "dde8de51-c56c-3683-8dd7-8dcecca5df33",
                        "entry_id": "478841d9-0f5b-31d9-9bce-773584dab6dc",
                        "glosses": [
                            "An egg."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "d554a3ad-4807-44c2-9a4d-69213a40db50",
                                "sense_id": "dde8de51-c56c-3683-8dd7-8dcecca5df33",
                                "text": "Perro prances merrily down the path, balancing his huevo jauntily on his nose, to the amazement of some watching chickens."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "605fe6ff-f703-4b07-9b7c-2c656e45055a",
                                "sense_id": "dde8de51-c56c-3683-8dd7-8dcecca5df33",
                                "text": "Day or night, huevos has long been a personal favorite, but they inevitably put me into a food coma. To lighten the load, I've slimmed down to just one huevo, and instead amped up the ratio of black beans (simmered in a saucepan, not refried, with aromatics and spices)."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "44a867d6-9f33-4482-afa5-49e9d1d54c31",
                                "sense_id": "dde8de51-c56c-3683-8dd7-8dcecca5df33",
                                "text": "you, who can't believe your Ma rose at 4:45 to fry one huevo and a slice of bologna laid on corn tortilla—border benedict— here's your chance to drag home $80 a week, for her electric."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c0151a16-6f51-4571-81b2-1e73cdf38347",
                                "sense_id": "dde8de51-c56c-3683-8dd7-8dcecca5df33",
                                "text": "It is hard to believe Jefe was only as big as a candy bar when he first came out of his huevo."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "8631e0cb-f15a-3bf1-88eb-d2e8e4b2d04c",
                        "entry_id": "478841d9-0f5b-31d9-9bce-773584dab6dc",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A testicle."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "plural-normally"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "95d371bb-6db2-4de6-a402-b0d8bb4a9cd2",
                                "sense_id": "8631e0cb-f15a-3bf1-88eb-d2e8e4b2d04c",
                                "text": "The horse has no huevos. The horse is a mare."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "769b0b05-82b2-4603-aa52-c70b95b82366",
                                "sense_id": "8631e0cb-f15a-3bf1-88eb-d2e8e4b2d04c",
                                "text": "\"I'd give my left huevo for any one of them,\" Leonardo said. \"But . . . but how?\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "cad0447c-fca5-4c02-bd30-b9c7ceee2570",
                                "sense_id": "8631e0cb-f15a-3bf1-88eb-d2e8e4b2d04c",
                                "text": "They were giant wooly monsters with huge curl horns and yellow eyes that saw everything. And below hung big huevos."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "32ce232a-36c0-4c95-b5b1-739aac1cb697",
                                "sense_id": "8631e0cb-f15a-3bf1-88eb-d2e8e4b2d04c",
                                "text": "But lately his brother had started walking as if he had baseballs packed in his pants instead of huevos the size of a hummingbird's."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c0a9bd1a-2847-45fb-838c-4a5b93849f7c",
                                "sense_id": "8631e0cb-f15a-3bf1-88eb-d2e8e4b2d04c",
                                "text": "Go stand naked in front of a male plastic surgeon. “One breast's lower than the other, we'll have to fix that...” Oh yeah, Doc? Let's see what you got. One huevo's hanging lower than the other."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
